Run aulod at login: a launchd agent, a systemd user unit or a Task Scheduler task

Usage: aulod service [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  install    Install and start the service for this home; a repeat changes nothing
  uninstall  Stop and remove the service
  status     Say whether the service is installed and running

Options:
      --home <DIR>  The aulo home, ahead of AULO_HOME and ~/.aulo
  -h, --help        Print help
